# Development Guides

Reference guides for agents working on projects powered by site-nine (s9).


## About These Guides

These guides cover **general development practices** for any project using the s9 agent orchestration framework. This
project ({{ project_name }}) uses these same practices.

Some guides contain project-specific sections that you should adapt to your project's needs.


## Quick Start

**New to s9-powered projects?** Start here:

1. [tasks.md](./tasks.md) - Learn the s9 task system
2. [markdown-style.md](./markdown-style.md) - Follow markdown formatting standards
3. [commit-guidelines.md](./commit-guidelines.md) - Write consistent commit messages


