## Documentation Standards


### [markdown-style.md](./markdown-style.md) ⚠️ **REQUIRED**

Markdown formatting rules for all `.md` files in s9 projects.

- Line wrapping (120 characters)
- Heading styles (ATX format, title case)
- Code blocks, lists, tables
- Blank line spacing (2 before H2/H3, 1 after headings)

**All agents must follow these formatting standards when editing markdown files.**


